 continuing on our adventure.\n\nhttps://www.thelandinggroup.ca/en/menu/hunters/happy-hour.html\n82 Fort York Blvd, Toronto, ON M5V 4A6\n\nBack down Bathurst to the lakeside to see\nOCAD University and the Delegation of the European Union to Canada - “The Light” and “Melting Temporalities” by Paul Murnaghan, Claire Brunet, Johnny Ranger #66\n\nThen over to one of my favourite summertime locations, the Toronto Music Garden to view.\nAscension by Ilene Sova #32\n\nWalking East along the waterfront we will arrive at The Grandmother Project by Peter Dillman #33\n\nSteps away is the Harbourfront Centre - Dance Stoops by Daily tous les jours #79\n\nOur final stop is at Love Park\nparol-parolan by HOT A!R ATEL!ER\n\nHere's the link to all the Nuit Blanche 2026 activities.\nhttps://www.toronto.ca/explore-enjoy/festivals-events/nuitblanche/all-art-projects/","eventType":"PHYSICAL","eventUrl":"https://www.meetup.com/beer-171/events/316709104/","isAttending":false,"isSaved":false,"maxTickets":0,"rsvpState":"JOIN_OPEN","featuredEventPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:536303434"},"displayPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:536303434"},"feeSettings":null,"group":{"__ref":"Group:602760"},"socialProofInsights":null,"rsvps":{"__typename":"RsvpConnection","totalCount":38,"edges":[{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":true,"member":{"__ref":"Member:5043195"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:374868019"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:199117982"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:12001997"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:296074061"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:481953104"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Mem